    "created_at": "2021-11-05T12:45:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-11-05T12:45:47Z",
    "body": "Something like `navigator.hid.revokeDevice(myDevice);` or `myDevice.forget()` that would revoke a user-generated permission seems like a good idea. I'm happy to send a spec PR if that helps.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
